# "Whenever Giott or another Dwarf you control enters ... you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card." Giott itself entering is the first of the events: Bot1 discards the
# Island and draws the Swamp from the top of the library (Bot1 goes first, so there is no draw before it). On turn 3 Giott's double strike (CR 702.4) deals its 1 power
# twice to the unblocked attacker's player: Bot2 is at 18.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Giott, King of the Dwarves
Island
Island
Island
Island
Swamp
Forest
Forest x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Giott, King of the Dwarves.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Island)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Island
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
? Bot1.Library.Count = 12
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Giott, King of the Dwarves > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Island; Island; Island; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Island
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Giott, King of the Dwarves.Keywords = DoubleStrike
